_pdbx_database_remark.id     600 
_pdbx_database_remark.text   
;
HETEROGEN
THERE IS AN EXTRA ATOM H21 IN MOLECULE 9IP. AUTHOR STATES
THAT THE MOLECULE 9IP IS PROTONATED (CHARGED) UNDER THE
PH CONDITIONS OF THE EXPERIMENT, AND THIS PROTONATION
STATE IS CRITICAL TO THE BINDING MODE OBSERVED.
;
